lean-sys-v433
=============

Vendored fork of digama0/lean-sys (https://github.com/digama0/lean-sys),
MIT OR Apache-2.0 dual-licensed by its authors:

    Jad Ghalayini <jeg74@cl.cam.ac.uk>
    Mario Carneiro <mcarneir@andrew.cmu.edu>
    Zhu Yifan <i@zhuyi.fan>

Fork point: upstream commit cb1a8e4996120d6a7b10b31b2d2235c237b8336f
(2025-09-24, crate version 0.0.9), which is pinned to the Lean 4.23 C API.

This fork carries the binding surface forward to leanprover/lean4 v4.33.0.
The applied drift fixes and the exact lean.h interface surface consumed are
recorded in lean-compat.md. The Apache-2.0 license text is carried in LICENSE
(upstream ships the Apache text; the MIT option is per the crate metadata).
